{%- comment -%}
  Renders the search icon.

  Source: phase-3-assets/icons/icon-search.svg, drawn in Phase 3 to the Phase 2
  contract — 24x24 canvas, stroke 1.5, currentColor, round caps and joins.

  Accepts:
  - class: {String} optional extra class names

  Usage:
  {% render 'icon-search' %}

  The icon is decorative here: every caller wraps it in a control that carries
  the accessible name, so it is hidden from assistive technology.
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg class="icon icon--search {{ class }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.25"/><path d="M15.6 15.6 20.5 20.5"/></svg>
